              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 525.77741,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "在此环境中。首先需要注意的是，单位级因果效应的无条件平均值 τi 没有实际意义，",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 75.84680000000002
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 31,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 449.8111999999998,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "因为处理措施并非以系统方式排序，因此无条件平均值在构造上为零。",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 95.93808
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 24,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 332.408267,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "LEMMA 1. 假设随机分配（假设 1）成立。那么",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 140.73938399999994
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 37,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 416.47618700000004,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "E[τ |A (0), A (1), Y (A (0)), Y (A (1)), X ] = 0.",
              "x": 195.529,
              "y": 174.4588
            },
            {
              "body": "i i i i i i i",
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 8,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": "i",
              "right": 390.073593,
              "size": 9.9626,
              "text": "i i i i i i i i",
              "x": 212.653,
              "y": 179.80540000000002
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 36,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 525.7774099999999,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "相反，我们关注 τi 的条件或加权平均值。这些权重取决于潜在治疗特征的函数，",
              "x": 103.11040000000001,
              "y": 203.86879999999996
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 40,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 535.528549376,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "也可能取决于单位级特征。我们将这些平均值称为条件治疗平均因果效应，或 C-TACE",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 223.00366400000004
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 17,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 275.505819,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "s，并在下一节中对其进行正式定义。",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 239.74094399999998
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 24,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 352.264361,
              "size": 15.493896,
              "text": "4. Estimands，处理特征函数与识别结果",
              "x": 100.053,
              "y": 299.35810399999997
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 53,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 532.210509,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "令 h : Rd ×Rd 7→ R p 为一个反对称函数，即 h(v, v′) = −h(v′, v)。一个自然的例子是差",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 355.3494
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 49,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 526.622827,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "异 h(v, v′) = v−v′。我们将其称为特征处理函数或 TCF。函数 h(v, v′) 在我们的分析中",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 372.08668
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 38,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 533.4975999999998,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "起着至关重要的作用。它定义了我们特征化处理的方向，并隐含地定义了该处理。这是",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 391.17036
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 21,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 330.2591999999999,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "研究人员的一项重要选择，也是关键性的选择。",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 407.90764
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 51,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 534.4987001279999,
              "size": 12.911616,
              "text": "TCF 定义了子群体 Ph(δ) ≡ {i : h(Vi, V Ni ) = δ}。假设 Vi 取两个值 0 和 1，且 h(",
              "x": 103.1104,
              "y": 443.9778
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 57,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 528.663369,
              "size": 12.911616,
              "text": "v, v′) = 1[v = 1, v′ = 0] − 1[v = 0, v′ = 1]。那么 Ph(1) 是那些 Vi = 1，V Ni = 0 的单元",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 460.71508
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 43,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 530.2481769999999,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "子群体，而 Ph(−1) 是那些 Vi = 0，V Ni = 1 的单元子群体。关键发现是，这两个子群",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 477.45236
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 47,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 532.745857,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "体 Ph(1) 和 Ph(−1)，以及更一般地，子群体 Ph(δ) 和 Ph(−δ)，可以通过随机化进行比",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 494.18864
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 2,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 103.1104,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "较。",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 514.28092
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 37,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 531.9520319999999,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "鉴于 TCF 的存在，我们可以定义我们的基本估计量，即条件治疗平均因果效应 (C",
              "x": 103.11040000000001,
              "y": 536.011384
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 7,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 133.466566,
              "size": 12.911616,
              "text": "-TACE)。",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 550.357624
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 39,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 462.118344,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "定义 2. （条件性治疗——平均因果效应）对于给定的 TCF h(v, v′) 和给定",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 579.1904000000001
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 14,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 221.95560899999998,
              "size": 12.911616,
              "text": "的特征差异 δ，C-TACE 为",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 594.9256240000001
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 21,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 376.15789399999994,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "τ (δ) ≡ E[τ |h(V , VN) = δ].",
              "x": 235.847,
              "y": 629.2824
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 4,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 339.043593,
              "size": 9.9626,
              "text": "h i i i",
              "x": 241.992,
              "y": 637.5734000000001
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 40,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 532.15117,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "在之前的示例中，有一个单一的二进制特征 Vi，τh(1) 表示那些被给予特征 Vi = 1",
              "x": 103.11040000000001,
              "y": 661.6358
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 36,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 485.805438,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "治疗的单元的平均治疗效果，而它们的替代未实现治疗则具有特征 V Ni = 0。",
              "x": 79.2,
              "y": 680.770664
            },
            {
              "body": null,
              "bold": false,
              "chars": 2,
              "page": 1,
              "pageHeight": 792,
              "pageWidth": 612,
              "printed": null,
              "right": 311.1643518,
              "size": 11.9552,
              "text": "17",
              "x": 300.584,
              "y": 751.2438
            }
          ],
          "number": 1,
          "width": 612
        }
      ]
    },
